39.137Z"}}, {"model": "Home.image", "pk": 47, "fields": {"album": 9, "image": "gallery_images/WhatsApp_Image_2024-05-24_at_17.09.57_4b63cfcb.jpg", "uploaded_at": "2024-05-28T15:35:50.249Z"}}, {"model": "Home.image", "pk": 48, "fields": {"album": 9, "image": "gallery_images/WhatsApp_Image_2024-05-24_at_17.09.54_63532d4e.jpg", "uploaded_at": "2024-05-28T15:36:13.019Z"}}, {"model": "Home.image", "pk": 49, "fields": {"album": 9, "image": "gallery_images/WhatsApp_Image_2024-05-24_at_17.09.47_8e61c305.jpg", "uploaded_at": "2024-05-28T15:36:36.061Z"}}, {"model": "Home.image", "pk": 50, "fields": {"album": 9, "image": "gallery_images/WhatsApp_Image_2024-05-24_at_17.09.38_690fcd01.jpg", "uploaded_at": "2024-05-28T15:36:46.268Z"}}, {"model": "Home.image", "pk": 51, "fields": {"album": 9, "image": "gallery_images/WhatsApp_Image_2024-05-24_at_17.09.53_7530872c.jpg", "uploaded_at": "2024-05-28T15:37:04.849Z"}}, {"model": "Home.image", "pk": 52, "fields": {"album": 9, "image": "gallery_images/WhatsApp_Image_2024-05-24_at_17.09.47_32ee142d.jpg", "uploaded_at": "2024-05-28T15:37:18.323Z"}}, {"model": "Home.image", "pk": 53, "fields": {"album": 9, "image": "gallery_images/WhatsApp_Image_2024-05-24_at_17.09.45_113c23f9.jpg", "uploaded_at": "2024-05-28T15:37:32.769Z"}}, {"model": "Home.image", "pk": 54, "fields": {"album": 9, "image": "gallery_images/WhatsApp_Image_2024-05-24_at_17.09.45_dfc24582.jpg", "uploaded_at": "2024-05-28T15:37:49.901Z"}}, {"model": "Home.image", "pk": 55, "fields": {"album": 9, "image": "gallery_images/WhatsApp_Image_2024-05-24_at_17.09.42_728c1a00.jpg", "uploaded_at": "2024-05-28T15:38:02.111Z"}}, {"model": "Home.aboutschool", "pk": 1, "fields": {"about_us": "Mar Ivanios School had a very humble beginning in 2003 with a fifty of tiny tots in a room attached to Bethany Convent, Chettukuzhy, Idukki. It is run by the sisters of the Imitation of Christ, the Religious Community founded by the late Mar Ivanios of Bethany. The school management eanestly desires and works to create a family atmosphere in the human society without any distinction of caste and creed. The school has a great vision. We are guided by sublime principles of genuine education, co-education, comprehensive curriculum, modern approaches in education and development of the individual, family and society etc.. are the basic thrust of the school.", "our_mission": "Mar Ivanios School had a very humble beginning in 2003 with a fifty of tiny tots in a room attached to Bethany Convent, Chettukuzhy, Idukki. It is run by the sisters of the Imitation of Christ, the Religious Community alni", "our_vision": "Mar Ivanios School had a very humble beginning in 2003 with a fifty of tiny tots in a room attached to Bethany Convent, Chettukuzhy, Idukki. It is run by the sisters of the Imitation of Christ, the Religious Community founded by the late Mar Ivanios of Bethany. The school management eanestly desires and works to create a family atmosphere in the human society without any distinction of caste and creed. The school has a great vision. We are guided by sublime principles of genuine education, co-education, comprehensive curriculum, modern approaches in education and development of the individual, family and society etc.. are the basic thrust of the school."}}, {"model": "Home.management", "pk": 1, "fields": {"our_principal": "​Sr. Ivan SIC", "principal_image": "images/princi.jpg", "principal_message": "<p>&quot;<strong>Listen to advice and accept instruction, that you may gain wisdom in the future.</strong>&quot; - Proverbs 19:20</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As we embark on the journey of the 2024-2025 academic year, I am honored to extend a warm welcome to each member of our cherished school community. At Mar Ivanios Bethany Public School Chettukuzhy, we uphold the profound words of Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam, who encourages us to maximize our time and achievements. Our mission is clear: to nurture an environment where every student can flourish academically, socially, and emotionally.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mahatma Gandhi envisioned education as &quot;an all-round drawing of the best in child and man in body, mind, and spirit.&quot; An education system that develops the imagination of the child is richer than the one that does not. The imagination is where new ideas are created and progress becomes possible. This allows students to explore themselves and become aware of their potential.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>School is a platform where, as far as possible, maximum exposures of various skill sets like problem-solving, leadership, adaptability, time management, and co-scholastic development must be given. We not only wish to nurture the academic and co-scholastic needs of the child but also aim to create memories that children shall cherish throughout life.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Education opens doors to limitless possibilities, and we are dedicated to instilling a lifelong passion for learning, fostering resilience, and nurturing curiosity among our students. Effective communication between home and school is fundamental to our shared success. Please do not hesitate to connect with us for any queries or concerns.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Under every adult&rsquo;s conscience, love, care, and respect, an individual turns into a confident personality. At Mar Ivanios Bethany, we celebrate diversity as our strength, cultivating an inclusive community where every student is honored, respected, and valued for their unique contributions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As we embark on this exciting new academic year together, I am filled with optimism and enthusiasm for the opportunities ahead. Let us collaborate wholeheartedly to ensure this year is both memorable and successful for everyone involved. Thank you for being an integral part of our exceptional school community.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Warm regards,</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Sr. Ivan SIC</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Principal</strong></p>", "our_finance_manager": "​Sr. Vineetha SIC", "finance_manager_image": "images/1689399454.jpg", "our_local_manager": "​​Sr. TessyPaul SIC", "local_manager_image": "images/1690022408.jpg"}}]